  "transcription": "Add. Ms a 94^{18 (95)} (95) (3)\n\n$9\\left(\\frac{x^3}{1-x^3}-\\frac{x^6}{1-x^6}+\\frac{x^{12}}{1-x^{12}}-\\frac{x^{15}}{1-x^{15}}+\\cdots\\right)$.\n(1.42) $\\frac{x(1-x^9)^3(1-x^{18})^3(1-x^{27})^3\\cdots}{(1-x^3)(1-x^6)(1-x^9)\\cdots}$\n$=\\frac{x}{1-x}-\\frac{x^2}{1-x^2}+\\frac{x^4}{1-x^4}-\\frac{x^5}{1-x^5}+\\cdots$\n$-\\left(\\frac{x^3}{1-x^3}-\\frac{x^6}{1-x^6}+\\frac{x^{12}}{1-x^{12}}-\\frac{x^{15}}{1-x^{15}}+\\cdots\\right)$,\n(1.51) $\\frac{(1-x)^5(1-x^2)^5(1-x^3)^5\\cdots}{(1-x^5)(1-x^{10})(1-x^{15})\\cdots}$\n$=1-5\\left(\\frac{x}{1-x}-\\frac{2x^2}{1-x^2}-\\frac{3x^3}{1-x^3}+\\frac{4x^4}{1-x^4}\\right.$\n$\\left.+\\frac{6x^6}{1-x^6}-\\frac{7x^7}{1-x^7}-\\frac{8x^8}{1-x^8}+\\cdots\\right)$.\n(1.52) $\\frac{x(1-x^5)^5(1-x^{10})^5(1-x^{15})^5\\cdots}{(1-x)(1-x^2)(1-x^3)\\cdots}$\n$=\\frac{x}{(1-x)^2}-\\frac{x^2}{(1-x^2)^2}-\\frac{x^3}{(1-x^3)^2}+\\frac{x^4}{(1-x^4)^2}$\n$+\\frac{x^6}{(1-x^6)^2}-\\frac{x^7}{(1-x^7)^2}-\\frac{x^8}{(1-x^8)^2}+\\cdots$\n(1.61) $(1+2x+2x^4+\\cdots)(1+2x^3+2x^{12}+\\cdots)$\n$=1+2\\left(\\frac{x}{1-x}-\\frac{x^2}{1+x^2}+\\frac{x^4}{1+x^4}-\\frac{x^5}{1-x^5}+\\cdots\\right)$\n(1.62) $(1+2x+2x^4+\\cdots)^2(1+2x^3+2x^{12}+\\cdots)^2$\n$=1+4\\left(\\frac{x}{1+x}+\\frac{2x^2}{1-x^2}+\\frac{4x^4}{1-x^4}+\\frac{5x^5}{1+x^5}+\\cdots\\right)$\n(1.71) $(1+2x+2x^4+\\cdots)(1+2x^7+2x^{28}+\\cdots)$\n$=1+2\\left(\\frac{x}{1+x}+\\frac{x^2}{1-x^2}-\\frac{x^3}{1+x^3}+\\frac{x^4}{1-x^4}-\\frac{x^5}{1+x^5}-\\frac{x^6}{1-x^6}\\right.$\n$\\left.+\\frac{x^8}{1-x^8}+\\frac{x^9}{1+x^9}-\\frac{x^{10}}{1-x^{10}}+\\cdots\\right)$.",
